 "_meta": {
  "about": "Where a reader lives -> the governments that make decisions binding on that place. M0 hand-map from the Ferric dossiers; every entry is boundary_verified:false until M5 rebuilds it from county tax-code-area data.",
  "updated": "2026-11-03",
  "truth": "Edit here (Ferric reference/notice-board/); notice_publish.py writes the merged copy to ~/notice-board/data/.",
  "changes": [
   "2026-11-03: added North Bonneville, Bingen and Dallesport / Murdock (cities and a water district that already had notices but no place). Bound Klickitat PUD to every Klickitat place, as M0 did for Skamania PUD. Bound the districts whose name pins them to a place: the Goldendale and Lyle school districts, White Salmon Valley SD (White Salmon, Bingen, Husum), the Lyle and Trout Lake fire districts, UPRD (Underwood). Every jurisdiction now carries its county: one that no place lists yet (ports, hospital, parks, other fire and school districts) shows for every place in that county, tagged as not mapped, instead of disappearing. Still boundary_verified:false everywhere until M5."
  ]
 },
